This product generates configuration for, and interoperates with, the
following independent projects. It does not bundle or redistribute their
code; the references below are for attribution and to make the ecosystem
Lantern targets explicit.

  - OpenTelemetry (https://opentelemetry.io)
    Apache License 2.0. Lantern emits Instrumentation and
    OpenTelemetryCollector custom resources consumed by the OpenTelemetry
    Operator, and generates queries against OpenTelemetry semantic
    conventions.

  - Prometheus and the Prometheus Operator (https://prometheus.io)
    Apache License 2.0. Lantern emits ServiceMonitor and PrometheusRule
    custom resources.

  - Grafana (https://grafana.com)
    AGPL-3.0 for the Grafana server; the grafana-operator and the Grafana
    Foundation SDK are Apache License 2.0. Planned dashboard generation
    targets the Foundation SDK and grafana-operator custom resources, not
    the Grafana server itself.

  - Google SRE Workbook (https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/)
    The multiwindow, multi-burn-rate alerting windows and factors Lantern
    generates are derived from the published SRE Workbook table.

